Description: Qt6 dialog window creator for shell scripts
 qt6sermo builds Qt6-based dialog windows from an XML-like description
 language. Most complete port: 42/42 widgets including QMenuBar,
 QCalendarWidget, QCheckBox(switch), QTableWidget, QFontDialog.
 Targets KDE Plasma 6, Qt-based desktops.
 Security: safe_exec, PIE, RELRO.
 .
 Toolkit: Qt6 — haplo-dialog fork 1.0.0.
 Security: safe_exec (no system()), FORTIFY_SOURCE=3, PIE, Full RELRO,
 stack-protector-strong.
